      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York, as a prime sponsor under the Comprehensive Employment and Training Act (CETA), is to undertake efforts to transition into unsubsidized employment its participants who exhaust their statutory period of public service employment, and",
