      "bbox": [
        419,
        980,
        1344,
        1066
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(c) Contracting Agency. The term \"Contracting Agency\" means any board, bureau, department, commission or other agency of the government of The City of New York which is authorized to and does, on behalf of the City, provide for, enter into, award, or administer contracts.",
